Subject: [PATCH 0861/3799] soh: rename func_808B0324 ->
 BgSpot08Bakudankabe_SpawnDebris

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: spawns the wall's destruction burst: 24 EffectSsKakera_Spawn shards, placed at the sDebrisOffsets positions rotated into world space by the wall's yaw and given randomised velocity.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot08_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot08_bakudankabe.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../ovl_Bg_Spot08_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot08_bakudankabe.c    | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot08_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot08_bakudankabe.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot08_Bakudankabe/z_bg_spot08_bakudankabe.c
